// title: "Highway connection-class index"
// summary: "Index measured traffic interfaces by class; class membership alone does not establish physical fit or game compatibility."
//
// Used when: Contributors inspect shared route-interface class membership or regenerate declared strict-JSON compatibility views; highway has no implemented pieces or extracted route interfaces, so this index is currently empty.
//
// Read by: custom-pieces/framework/scp/jsonc.py sync_legacy_exports() reads this source to emit connection-classes.json beside it, and shared-source tests compare those payloads; catalogue loading and build selection do not use this index as an authority.
//
// Updated by: custom-pieces/framework/scp/content.py refresh_catalog_content() derives classes from supplied extracted port records only when a full metadata refresh includes pieces in the owning domain; the current empty highway domain supplies no such records, and the declared legacy-export command only copies the existing payload into strict JSON.
//
// Affects: The generated route-class membership view and its compatibility export; membership alone establishes neither physical boundary fit nor game compatibility, and the empty file supplies no highway measurement or traffic result.
//
// Reference: custom-pieces/docs/CONNECTOR_METADATA.md
